<Meta of={<%= storiesName %>} name="Overview" />

# <%= title %>

A component the `<%= slot %>` slot places by its registered ID, `<%= componentId %>`, so a manifest
puts it on screen with no rebuild. It shows a heading<% if (isDocumentView) { %> and the title of the document the page is showing<% } %>.
Use it <%- host.whenToUse %>.

## Key features

- **Placed by a manifest.** It is registered as `<%= componentId %>`, so a `<%= slot %>` entry
  naming it puts it on screen, and removing the entry takes it off, with no rebuild.
- **A real heading.** The heading is a native `<h1>` to `<h6>`, at the level you choose, so
  heading navigation stays in order. A blank heading renders nothing.<% if (isDocumentView) { %>
- **The page's document.** The `documentView` slot passes the focused document as `document`, so
  it always describes the document the toolbar and the properties panel act on.<% } %>
- **Theme tokens only.** Its colours and type come from the theme, so it is the same component
  with or without Satori.

